<aside class="auth-aside" aria-label="About ShopExpress">
    <div class="auth-aside__content">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light"><span class="eyebrow__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span> Members of ShopExpress</p>
        <h2>Fewer things.<br><em>Chosen better.</em></h2>
        <p>A small catalog, a long view. Your account keeps the objects you’ve chosen close at hand.</p>
        <ul class="auth-aside__list">
            <li><%- icon('shopping-bag') %> Keep your cart across visits</li>
            <li><%- icon('receipt') %> Follow every order in one place</li>
            <li><%- icon('truck') %> Complimentary shipping, always</li>
        </ul>
        <blockquote class="auth-aside__quote">
            <p>“The kind of shop you return to because everything already feels considered.”</p>
            <cite>The ShopExpress edit</cite>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-aside__media" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/products/arc-task-lamp.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="1000">
        <span class="auth-aside__caption">The 2026 collection / Object no. 01</span>
    </div>
</aside>
